OVE.&#xa;ModerationLog.targetId is a scalar identifier, not a JPA relationship to ServiceComplaint. DTO records and unrelated members are omitted.&#xa;Solid arrows: navigable associations; dashed arrows: dependencies; filled diamonds: owned image values. Multiplicities are shown in relationship labels." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=13;fillColor=#F0FDFA;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1515" width="1790" height="125" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="64" value="Service Complaint — Class Diagram" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="22" width="1790" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="65" value="Source-based view of the shared backend model and application classes" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="77" width="1790" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>